  "nameEn": "Fork in the Forest",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Walk the path for 8 steps. Before a tree try turning right, and if there is an obstacle there too — turn the robot left. Light all the lamps.",
  "descriptionEn": "The forest path bends right and then left, and lamps stand along it. Choose the right turn and do not forget the light.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Walk the path for 8 steps. Before a tree try turning right, and if there is an obstacle there too — turn the robot left. Turn off all the lamps."
